not represent the unconditional exceedance hazard of the published mixed
models. For JB07 and SR08 (\code{\link[=evaluateRigidDisplacement]{evaluateRigidDisplacement()}}), the Arias
intensity is \code{\link[=estimateAI]{estimateAI()}} of each site-amplified PGA, without additional
dispersion of the Arias intensity.

Repeated AEP nodes retain the largest Sa. Curves are interpolated linearly
